[?2004l[?2004h>         "answer": "Lopinavir-Ritonavir oral solution must be taken with food to enhance absorption. It is not recommended for use with polyurethane feeding tubes due to potential incompatibility, but compatible tubes such as silicone or polyvinyl chloride (PVC) feeding tubes can be used. Caregivers and patients should pay special attention to accurate dose administration, utilizing a calibrated dosing cup or oral dosing syringe to minimize the risk of accidental overdose or underdose. Step-by-step instructions include removing the bottle adapter, inserting it, firmly placing the oral syringe tip in the adapter, turning the bottle upside down, drawing up the prescribed dose, checking for accuracy, and swallowing the solution directly from the oral syringe.",
